 "summary": "The behavioral package of the Azazael tree: a therapeutic-agent loop, the psychological network it reasons over, the compiled-inference layer that makes it fast, the construct battery that can finally measure a person, and the evaluation instruments that grade all four. Its intended role is the live counselor -- the continuity layer of addiction and mental-health care -- and docs/explanation/live-counselors.md states both that aim and the requirements it does not yet meet. Published with its limitations, including a measured crisis-router recall that ranges from 0.83 to 0.18 across three self-authored holdouts -- a spread that says the single number does not exist yet.",
